# Shell scripts are checked out LF on EVERY platform.
#
# This repo's checkouts include Windows boxes with core.autocrlf=true, which would
# otherwise hand out CRLF copies of the gates. A `\r` in a shell script is the worst
# class of bug this repo has: bash fails in ways that read as "the check found nothing"
# rather than "the check could not run". Pin the line endings instead.
*.sh text eol=lf
